<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cenbank sells 182-day BBCs at 2.259 pct.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cenbank sells 182-day BBCs at 2.259 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold 1.816 billion reais of 182-day Central Bank Bonds (BBC) Tuesday at an overnight call money rate of 2.259 percent a month, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rate at the bank's weekly formal bond auction was in line with market expectations.</p>
<p>The auction result show that 316 million reais will be drained from the banking system as 1.5 billion reais in 182-day old bonds are coming due Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroon, 55 11 2485418))</p>
